{
  "id": "004",
  "title": "Phone Call",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2015-12-05",
  "synopsis": "Making a phone call in a language you’re not comfortable with can be scary. This lesson shows a simple phone conversation between two friends.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/4/c64d2ada9f6d0b23e1f5a95015e92d4228793a17.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "打电话\n\n    喂，小李，我下飞机了。现在准备坐出租车去饭店和一个朋友吃饭。吃完饭后，我再给你打电话吧。",
    "traditional": "打電話\n\n    喂，小李，我下飛機了。現在準備坐出租車去飯店和一個朋友吃飯。吃完飯後，我再給你打電話吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Phone call"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "喂，小李，我下飞机了。",
      "traditional": "喂，小李，我下飛機了。",
      "pinyin": "wéi xiǎo lǐ wǒ xià fēi jī le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "现在准备坐出租车去饭店和一个朋友吃饭。",
      "traditional": "現在準備坐出租車去飯店和一個朋友吃飯。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài zhǔn bèi zuò chū zū chē qù fàn diàn hé yí ge péng you chī fàn",
      "english": "Hello, Xiao Li, I got off the plane."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "吃完饭后，我再给你打电话吧。",
      "traditional": "吃完飯後，我再給你打電話吧。",
      "pinyin": "chī wán fàn hòu wǒ zài gěi nǐ dǎ diàn huà ba",
      "english": "I'm just about to enter a taxi to go to a resturant to eat with a friend."
    }
  ],
